results.model_answer:
According to DOCUMENT 2 (the Express Cargo Clearance Rules, 2024), Rule 13 specifies the scope of items that are prohibited from being cleared under the express service regime, even if imported via express service. These items are:

- অতি মূল্যবান এবং মূল্যবান দ্রব্য (highly valuable and valuable goods);
- প্রাণী এবং উদ্ভিদ (animals and plants);
- পচনশীল পণ্য (perishable goods);
